## 🚀 Exploitation / Solution Path
Detail your step-by-step breakdown to get the flag:
1. Download the `disassembler-dump0_a.txt` file using `wget`.
2. See the content using `cat` command.
3. Open the `python interpreter or cyberchef(fromhex)` to convert the `hexadecimal value to decimal value`
4. The flag will be displayed.

